*Additional Information*

* Once Proxy is configured, the network tray icon indicates that no network access is available. Look for the UMS Tray Icon. It shows that connectivity is still available to the UMS. This and the successful test for connectivity with a browser will tell you if Proxy configurations are successfully applied.
* Currently there is an open Bug [https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/browse/APPS-1776|https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/browse/APPS-1776|smart-link] 
