*Important Registry Keys*

_app.<browser>.sessions.<sessionname>.login_method_ 

*Additional Information*

For this test you need to create 2 different Browser Sessions.
Change the registry key of each of the sessions. Set one to _User_ and the other to _Guest_
Keep in mind, Guest Account can only run apps from the desktop

This test case contains all basic configurations and features of Chromium that are not treated as a policy.

Further Information:

* by default chrome://* is blocked; set "URLBlocklist" to ";" to unblock all urls
* Use umount /services_rw/chromium/userhome/.config/chromium/WidevineCdm if terminal/chromium reports that deleting/changing any data is not possible.

